          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yesaya mwene Amosi atuma kuri Hezekiya, ut’ Uku ni k’ Uhoraho, Imana y’Abisirayeli, agize, ngw Ivyo wamutakambiye ku vya Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri, yavyumvise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ut’ Iri ni ryo jambo Uhoraho yamuvuzeko, at’ Umukobga w’inkumi w’i Siyoni aragukēngereye, agutwengeye mw ijigo; umukobga w’i Yerusalemu akuzungurije umutwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo watonganije ukamurogotako ni nde? Ni nde wirahiye akararamango ukamurābana agakēngērwe? Erega ni jewe Uwera w’Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.8.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 8:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.8.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.14.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watumye abantu bawe kuntuka, jewe Umwami Imana, uravuga, ng’ Udūganye igitero cinshi c’imikogote yawe y’intambara, ushitse mu mpinga z’imisozi, no mu dushōka tw’i Lebanoni; ngo Wiciye ibiti vy’amasederi vyaho birebire, n’ivy’ akajwari vyaho vyiza‐vyiza; ngo Wahanyuragiye ushika ku mpinga yaho hirya cane, no mu biti vyo mw itongo ryaho rimera cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo Wimvye amazi urayanywa; wakamishije inzūzi zo muri Egiputa ubgōro bg’ ibirenge vyawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
