              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "31:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umumarayika w’Uhoraho arasohoka, atera mu nsago z’Abashuri, yicamw’ ingabo ibihumbi ijana na mirongumunani na bitanu: abantu bavyutse mu gatondo basanga ingabo zose ar’ imihindigiti y’imivyimba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri aca arataha, asubira inyuma, aja kuba i Ninewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umusi ur’ izina, arikw arasenga mu ngoro y’ikigirwamana ciwe citwa Nisiroki, Adurameleki na Sharezeri abana biwe bamwicisha inkota; baca bahungira mu gihugu c’i Ararati. Maz’ umuhungu wiwe Esarihadoni asubira ku ngoma yiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.38"
            ]
          }
        }
